{"chunk_id":"chk_cd2b24f9f8f352d8397e90f4ecf7d271","source_id":"src-benefits-en","document_version":1,"ordinal":0,"text":"# Benefits and Leave Policy","content_digest":"6a9dca337a47565f69b321565d7b76b97cbb639d468172ecce0a44fdc0f654e4","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["Benefits and Leave Policy"],"char_start":0,"char_end":27},"language":"en","extraction_method":"text","token_count":5}
{"chunk_id":"chk_7194fb5dc18883e733cd16af2b3a010c","source_id":"src-benefits-en","document_version":1,"ordinal":1,"text":"## Annual leave\n\nFull-time employees receive 20 working days of paid annual leave per calendar year. Leave requests for three or more consecutive working days should be submitted at least ten calendar days before the first day of leave.","content_digest":"06c95aa0d18ac3651f8f026f0f5369eb0e798d44c707cfd5ebab367f9ae99af7","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["Benefits and Leave Policy","Annual leave"],"char_start":29,"char_end":265},"language":"en","extraction_method":"text","token_count":42}
{"chunk_id":"chk_9f0b3f681a73323e217ba3f98dd6365a","source_id":"src-benefits-en","document_version":1,"ordinal":2,"text":"## Remote work\n\nEmployees may work remotely for up to two days per week when their manager approves the schedule. Remote work does not change the employee's normal information-security responsibilities.","content_digest":"3c1c3ad7d2b0181699056e284692e677f5db0ae0510d4328abec36ea57af1c09","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["Benefits and Leave Policy","Remote work"],"char_start":267,"char_end":469},"language":"en","extraction_method":"text","token_count":33}
{"chunk_id":"chk_411f370dd1d0636883d060dc29b88018","source_id":"src-travel-zh","document_version":1,"ordinal":0,"text":"# 境内差旅与报销政策","content_digest":"69ca23b4e0cebf325cead918eed2d7c9dc3d86b2a94309fe6d39b7e697525f7c","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["境内差旅与报销政策"],"char_start":0,"char_end":11},"language":"zh","extraction_method":"text","token_count":10}
{"chunk_id":"chk_2440923d990d8d056c9a972ac5202947","source_id":"src-travel-zh","document_version":1,"ordinal":1,"text":"## 交通标准\n\n员工乘坐高铁出差时，标准席位为二等座。因无票等业务原因需要升级席位时，必须在报销单中附上直属经理的书面批准。","content_digest":"01737bafa3cae8004fd3126c691e14390e951463f2403787a4475631dd6fb877","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["境内差旅与报销政策","交通标准"],"char_start":13,"char_end":76},"language":"zh","extraction_method":"text","token_count":60}
{"chunk_id":"chk_071908b9c04e8e4af44ea463ce51ed0f","source_id":"src-travel-zh","document_version":1,"ordinal":2,"text":"## 报销时限\n\n差旅结束后，员工应在三十个自然日内提交报销申请，并附上合规票据。财务团队会在材料齐全后进行审核。","content_digest":"2d8784fed600f94a563304c3a880a40b4b1e5488c4ee3e607373bf9999ecd56c","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["境内差旅与报销政策","报销时限"],"char_start":78,"char_end":135},"language":"zh","extraction_method":"text","token_count":54}
{"chunk_id":"chk_21bf5544d8bc2b8fbf9139333341ec08","source_id":"src-security-bilingual","document_version":1,"ordinal":0,"text":"# Security Help / 安全支持","content_digest":"85465957a344dd6dd495e7bf58b82f2d1f1a550f2e4b5c88ebe22ea30e192c00","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["Security Help / 安全支持"],"char_start":0,"char_end":22},"language":"mixed","extraction_method":"text","token_count":8}
{"chunk_id":"chk_0c4a8d51b69ad763e39fb336deed244b","source_id":"src-security-bilingual","document_version":1,"ordinal":1,"text":"## Incident reporting\n\nEmployees should report a suspected security incident through the internal incident portal. The synthetic training contact printed in this sample is helpdesk@example.invalid; it is reserved for evaluation and does not reach a real person.","content_digest":"aff8c2f267a8affacb522515daed3f14df342486fc90792b0e97fa3dd5cd58e6","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["Security Help / 安全支持","Incident reporting"],"char_start":24,"char_end":285},"language":"mixed","extraction_method":"text","token_count":43}
{"chunk_id":"chk_23677766a2cf21f87af44586896c0f8f","source_id":"src-security-bilingual","document_version":1,"ordinal":2,"text":"## 安全事件报告\n\n发现疑似安全事件后，员工应使用内部事件门户提交报告。不得在公共聊天频道中粘贴访问令牌、密码或客户数据。","content_digest":"2eb41ac1d10265ca4ec83d3352481fdab1e834388238fd836891afd73d342506","locator":{"pages":[],"section_path":["Security Help / 安全支持","安全事件报告"],"char_start":287,"char_end":349},"language":"mixed","extraction_method":"text","token_count":59}
